Generic single-database configuration.

Set DATABASE_URL in .env to a MySQL 8 connection using the PyMySQL driver and
utf8mb4, then run:

    python -m alembic upgrade head

The migration chain creates the normalized application schema, seeds career
catalog data, adds analysis report fields, and adds hashed refresh-token
sessions. Migrations preserve existing user/profile/CV data and do not create
an Admin account. See the repository README for the secure Admin bootstrap
command.